# Raw page dumps kept on disk for debugging. Never published, since they are
# large scraped HTML and carry no value to a reader of the repo.
cv_*.out

# Agent scratch notes. Ignored rather than curated, because they record
# working assumptions about the author that the code itself does not.
.claude/

# The known-defect register, its two companions, and the research notes. Local
# only, because each records what a real run did against a private mailbox.
#
# The case has to match the file on disk. A rule written `Todo.md` still matches
# on Windows, where core.ignorecase is true, and silently stops matching on a
# case-sensitive runner, which is where the file would actually be published.
Pending_fix.md
REVIEW_FINDINGS.md
DECISIONS.md
Known_concern.md
PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md
CLAUDE.local.md
notes/

# Editor and hand-made backups. Committing one publishes a stale second copy of
# a file that is already in the tree.
*.bak
